  "title": "Duke Energy Florida launches Residential Battery Storage Pilot in Orlando’s Hunter’s Creek neighborhood",
  "summary": "Duke Energy Florida has launched an energy-saving pilot project in the Hunter’s Creek neighborhood of Orlando. As part of the initiative, battery energy storage systems (BESS) have been installed in more than 75 participating single-family homes to help manage energy use and support the electric grid during high-demand periods.",
